00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Bee remembers what I say. Nectar makes sure I do it.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:16,500
Here is Nectar running live on my Bee data. I tell a colleague: I'll send Mariama the document in ten minutes.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Nectar finds the promise with Claude Haiku and creates a Bee to-do with an alarm.

4
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:35,000
